---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import me from "../assets/images/me.png";
import Icon from "../lib/@ui/Icon";
import Heading from "../lib/@ui/typography/Heading";
import Text from "../lib/@ui/typography/Text";
---
<div
  class="flex flex-col items-center lg:flex-row gap-6"
>
  <figure>
    <Picture
      background="white"
      src={me}
      role="presentation"
      alt=""
      width={400}
      height={400}
      widths={[400, 500, 600, 700, 800, 900, 1000]}
      formats={['avif', 'webp', 'png']}
      sizes="400px"
      class="lg:max-w-sm xl:max-w-md rounded-md overflow-hidden shadow-md"
    />
  </figure>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
    <Heading as="h2">
      Learn from <em><Text gradient="warning" as="span">who</Text></em>?
    </Heading>
    <Text>
      Hi again 👋. I'm Chris D. MacRae, a fullstack engineer and
      designer whose been working with tech for over <em>10 years</em>.
    </Text>
    <Text>
      <Text gradient="info" as="span">
        <strong>Teaching and mentorship</strong>
      </Text> has always been my passion, but doing it 1:1 doesn't scale.
      Thus, in 2026 my goal is to use this site to start providing more mentorship,
      training, and tutorials as possible, to as wide an audience as I possibly
      can.
    </Text>
    <Text>
      I work at <a href="https://careguide.com" rel="noopener"
        ><Text gradient="primary" as="span">
          <strong>Careguide</strong>
        </Text></a
      >
      as a Senior Engineer, where I work a team of 8 engineers and 2 designers.
    </Text>
    <Text>
      Learn more about me, such as my <a href="/using">favorite tools</a>,
      <a href="/projects">projects</a>, or <a href="/about">personal history</a>.
    </Text>
  </div>
</div>